is whitespace-nowrap text-white">pick [n]one</div><div class="mt-[0.625rem] flex items-center gap-[0.25rem]"><div class="h-[1.5rem] flex-[0_0_1.5rem]"><img alt="" src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/splash-page/clips/d882e626.webp" data-src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/splash-page/clips/d882e626.webp" class="h-full w-full rounded-full" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="flex-1 text-[0.730313rem] leading-[0.973812rem] font-medium">MC Escher</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><script>$RC("B:3","S:3")</script><div hidden id="S:4"><div><section class="w-full bg-background-primary py-[6.25rem]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[77.5rem] px-5 justify-center"><div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><h1 class="font-sans font-medium text-foreground-primary  select-none whitespace-pre-wrap text-[2.1875rem] leading-[2.1875rem] lg:text-[4.5rem] lg:leading-[4rem] whitespace-pre-line max-w-[47.5rem]">Everything you need to make music your way</h1></div><div class="mb-[4.5rem]"></div><div class="mb-12"><div class="relative"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-8 overflow-x-auto"><div id="product-v6" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><a class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none" href="/v6"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">v6, our newest model</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Our most capable model yet, with fuller vocals, tighter arrangements and more of the detail you asked for.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/cms/cdn-o-product-pages/splash-page/product-tiles/v6.jpg" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:208px;width:312px"/></div></a></div><div id="product-studio" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><a class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none" href="/studio-welcome"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Suno Studio</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">A browser-based DAW for arranging, editing and mixing every part of a song until it is exactly yours.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/cms/cdn-o-product-pages/splash-page/product-tiles/studio.jpg" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:208px;width:312px"/></div></a></div><div id="product-voices" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><a class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none" href="/voices"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Voices</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Record a few seconds of your own voice, then hear it sing anything you write, in any style.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/cms/cdn-o-product-pages/splash-page/product-tiles/voices.jpg" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:208px;width:312px"/></div></a></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 w-12 bg-gradient-to-l from-dumbo-50/30 to-transparent md:hidden"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-dumbo-50/30 to-transparent md:hidden"></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-center sm:hidden"><div class="flex space-x-2"><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/80"></div><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/30"></div><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/30"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-12"><div class="relative"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-8 overflow-x-auto"><div id="product-stem-separation" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><a class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none" href="/stem-separation"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Stem separation</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Pull any song apart into clean, time-aligned stems and carry them into the DAW you already use.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/cms/cdn-o-product-pages/splash-page/product-tiles/stem-separation.jpg" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:208px;width:312px"/></div></a></div><div id="product-remix" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><a class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none" href="/remix-welcome"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Remix</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Take a song somewhere new. Change its style, rewrite the lyrics or rebuild it around your own recording.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/cms/cdn-o-product-pages/splash-page/product-tiles/remix.jpg" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:208px;width:312px"/></div></a></div><div id="product-custom-models" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><a class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none" href="/custom-models"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Custom models</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Train a model on your own recordings so every song it makes starts from your sound.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/cms/cdn-o-product-pages/splash-page/product-tiles/custom-models.jpg" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:208px;width:312px"/></div></a></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 w-12 bg-gradient-to-l from-dumbo-50/30 to-transparent md:hidden"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-dumbo-50/30 to-transparent md:hidden"></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-center sm:hidden"><div class="flex space-x-2"><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/80"></div><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/30"></div><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/30"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-12"><div class="relative"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-8 overflow-x-auto"><div id="product-music-library" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><a class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none" href="/music-library"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Music library</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Browse songs by genre, mood and occasion, whether you need a reference, a spark or the right track for a project.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/splash-page/highlights/highlight%205-v2.png" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:180px;width:317px"/></div></a></div><div id="feature-free-generator" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><button type="button" class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none text-left"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Free AI music generator</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Make music for free every day with the AI song generator millions already use, then explore what others have made, from inside jokes to raw emotion.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/splash-page/highlights/highlight%204.png" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:180.573px;width:180.578px"/></div></button></div><div id="feature-share-with-world" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><button type="button" class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none text-left"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Share it with the world</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Make music that matters to you, then share it with people who’ll feel it too. From your inner circle to millions of music fans, your next track can go far.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/splash-page/highlights/highlight%206.png" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:180px;width:303px"/></div></button></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 w-12 bg-gradient-to-l from-dumbo-50/30 to-transparent md:hidden"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-dumbo-50/30 to-transparent md:hidden"></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-center sm:hidden"><div class="flex space-x-2"><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/80"></div><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/30"></div><div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-white/30"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-8 overflow-x-auto"><div id="feature-voices" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><button type="button" class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none text-left"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Granular creation controls</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Steer your style with Voices, Inspo, exclusions and vocal gender. Or get even more granular and experiment with weirdness and style sliders.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/splash-page/highlights/highlight-granular-tools.png" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:180px;width:280px"/></div></button></div><div id="feature-commercial-rights" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><button type="button" class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none text-left"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Commercial rights to your songs</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Songs you create as a paid Suno subscriber are yours to keep and do whatever you want with them, from using them as background music in videos to publishing an album.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/splash-page/highlights/highlight-commercial-rights.png" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:180px;width:200px"/></div></button></div><div id="feature-create-everyday" data-loaded="true" class="flex-shrink-0 snap-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px)"><button type="button" class="flex h-full min-h-[28.75rem] w-[23.5rem] max-w-[90vw] min-w-[18.75rem] shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-background-fog-thin p-8 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/60 focus-visible:outline-none text-left"><div class="mb-4 w-full"><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[1.25rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white">Create everyday. Keep it all.</h3><div class="mb-6 font-sans text-[1rem] leading-6 font-medium text-white/70">Make up to 500 custom songs a month, with full commercial rights on the Pro plan. Get inspired, break genre boundaries, and own what you generate—no strings attached.</div></div><div class="m-auto flex w-full justify-center"><img src="https://cdn-o.suno.com/splash-page/highlights/highlight%202.png" alt="" class="rounded-[0.75rem] object-contain" style="height:188.933px;width:312.038px"/></div></button></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 w-12 bg-gradient-to-l from-dumbo-50/30 to-transparent md:hidden"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-dumbo-50/30 to-transparent md:hidden"></div><div