] leading-[0.973812rem] font-medium text-ellipsis whitespace-nowrap text-white"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline" href="https://instagram.com/techguyver">@<!-- -->techguyver</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><script>$RC("B:7","S:7")</script><div hidden id="S:8"><div><section class="mx-auto mt-[6.25rem] max-w-[50rem] bg-background-primary px-5 md:mt-[10rem]"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why is Suno the best AI music generator?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most AI music generators produce short instrumental loops. Suno helps you create complete, original songs – vocals, lyrics, full production – from a single text prompt in under a minute, across every genre.\n\nFeatured in Rolling Stone, Billboard, Wired, and Variety, Suno is used by everyone from first-time creators to top producers and songwriters. We're a top 10 music app on iOS and Android."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I make a song with Suno?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Go to suno.com, describe the song you want – genre, mood, theme, or your own lyrics – and hit Create. Suno helps you build a complete track with vocals, instrumentation, and production in under a minute. Regenerate, extend, or refine from there. Whether you're after a full song or just an instrumental, Suno works as a beat maker, AI song generator and song creator in one."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need any music experience to use Suno?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No experience needed. Suno is built for everyone – people making music for the first time and chart-topping pros alike. Describe what you want in plain language: a genre, a mood, a topic, even a few lyrics. From there, you shape the melody, harmony, vocals, and production into exactly what you're hearing in your head."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use AI to make music?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. With Suno's AI song generator, you can create complete, original songs just by describing what you want. Type a genre, a mood, an idea – \"chill lo-fi beat about rainy mornings\" – and Suno helps you build a full track with vocals, lyrics, and production in seconds. Millions of people are already using AI to make music: for fun, for content, for professional projects."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Suno free to use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Suno is a free AI music generator that lets you create up to 10 songs a day, no credit card required.\n\nWhen you're ready to go further, paid plans unlock more. The Pro plan gives you 500 songs a month, royalty free music, access to v5.5 - Suno's best and most personalized AI music model – commercial use rights, priority generation, the Song Editor, stem separation into vocal and instrument stems, and audio uploads of up to 8 minutes. It's the go-to plan for content creators, songwriters, and anyone looking for royalty free music for YouTube, podcasts, ads, or any commercial project.\n\nThe Premier plan is built for serious creators and producers. On top of everything in Pro, you get 2,000 songs a month, access to Suno Studio – the first-ever generative audio workstation – a multitrack editor, MIDI export, Persona Voices, and early access to new features. It's a full AI music production suite in your browser.\n\nBoth paid plans are available at a 20% discount with annual billing."}}]}</script><div class="text-center"><div></div><h2 class="font-sans text-[2.1875rem] leading-[2.1875rem] font-medium text-foreground-primary lg:text-[4.5rem] lg:leading-[4rem]">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[24.375rem] text-[1rem] leading-6 text-white/70 md:text-[1.125rem]">Everything you need to know about making music with Suno.</p></div><div class="mt-[3.75rem]"><div class="border-b border-white/10 transition-colors duration-200 has-[button:hover]:border-white/25"><h3><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-6 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="pr-4 text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-foreground-primary md:text-[1.25rem]">Why is Suno the best AI music generator?</span><span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[1.5rem] text-foreground-primary" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;opacity:0"><p class="pr-12 pb-6 text-[1rem] leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line text-white/70">Most AI music generators produce short instrumental loops. Suno helps you create complete, original songs – vocals, lyrics, full production – from a single text prompt in under a minute, across every genre.

Featured in Rolling Stone, Billboard, Wired, and Variety, Suno is used by everyone from first-time creators to top producers and songwriters. We&#x27;re a top 10 music app on iOS and Android.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10 transition-colors duration-200 has-[button:hover]:border-white/25"><h3><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-6 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="pr-4 text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-foreground-primary md:text-[1.25rem]">How do I make a song with Suno?</span><span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[1.5rem] text-foreground-primary" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;opacity:0"><p class="pr-12 pb-6 text-[1rem] leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line text-white/70">Go to suno.com, describe the song you want – genre, mood, theme, or your own lyrics – and hit Create. Suno helps you build a complete track with vocals, instrumentation, and production in under a minute. Regenerate, extend, or refine from there. Whether you&#x27;re after a full song or just an instrumental, Suno works as a beat maker, AI song generator and song creator in one.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10 transition-colors duration-200 has-[button:hover]:border-white/25"><h3><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-6 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="pr-4 text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-foreground-primary md:text-[1.25rem]">Do I need any music experience to use Suno?</span><span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[1.5rem] text-foreground-primary" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;opacity:0"><p class="pr-12 pb-6 text-[1rem] leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line text-white/70">No experience needed. Suno is built for everyone – people making music for the first time and chart-topping pros alike. Describe what you want in plain language: a genre, a mood, a topic, even a few lyrics. From there, you shape the melody, harmony, vocals, and production into exactly what you&#x27;re hearing in your head.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10 transition-colors duration-200 has-[button:hover]:border-white/25"><h3><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-6 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="pr-4 text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-foreground-primary md:text-[1.25rem]">Can I use AI to make music?</span><span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[1.5rem] text-foreground-primary" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;opacity:0"><p class="pr-12 pb-6 text-[1rem] leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line text-white/70">Yes. With Suno&#x27;s AI song generator, you can create complete, original songs just by describing what you want. Type a genre, a mood, an idea – &quot;chill lo-fi beat about rainy mornings&quot; – and Suno helps you build a full track with vocals, lyrics, and production in seconds. Millions of people are already using AI to make music: for fun, for content, for professional projects.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10 transition-colors duration-200 has-[button:hover]:border-white/25"><h3><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between py-6 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="pr-4 text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-foreground-primary md:text-[1.25rem]">Is Suno free to use?</span><span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[1.5rem] text-foreground-primary" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;opacity:0"><p class="pr-12 pb-6 text-[1rem] leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line text-white/70">Yes. Suno is a free AI music generator that lets you create up to 10 songs a day, no credit card required.

When you&#x27;re ready to go further, paid plans unlock more. The Pro plan gives you 500 songs a month, royalty free music, access to v5.5 - Suno&#x27;s best and most personalized AI music model – commercial use rights, priority generation, the Song Editor, stem separation into vocal and instrument stems, and audio uploads of up to 8 minutes. It&#x27;s the go-to plan for content creators, songwriters, and anyone looking for royalty free music for YouTube, podcasts, ads, or any commercial project.

The Premier plan is built for serious creators and producers. On top of everything in Pro, you get 2,000 songs a month, access to Suno Studio – the first-ever generative audio workstation – a multitrack editor, MIDI export, Persona Voices, and early access to new features. It&#x27;s a full AI music production suite in your browser.

Both paid plans are available at a 20% discount with annual billing.</p></div></div></div><a class="group mt-1 block py-6 text-center text-[1rem] text-white/40 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white/60 md:text-[1.125rem]" href="https://help.suno.com">See the full FAQ<!-- --> <span class="inline-block transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span></a><div class="mt-[3.75rem] mb-[2.5rem] text-center md:mb-[7.5rem]"><button type="button" tabindex="0" class="hxc-btn-base hxc-btn-variant-aura hxc-btn-size-large hxc-btn-shape-pill hxc-btn-background px-[4.875rem]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hxc-btn-overlay-slot hxc-btn-border"></span><span class="hxc-btn-content">Join Suno for free</span></button></div></section></div></div><script>$RC("B:8","S:8")</script><div hidden id="S:9"><div><footer aria-label="Footer" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[77.5rem] px-5 z-50 py-[0.9375rem] md:pt-0"><div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-between md:flex-row"><div class="flex w-full flex-2 md:w-auto"><div class="mb-[2.5rem] flex flex-1 flex-col items-start md:mb-0"><div><div class="text-[1rem] leading-[155%] font-medium text-foreground-primary-on-dark">Brand</div><div><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[0.75rem] leading-[155%] font-medium text-foreground-primary-on-dark transition-colors hover:text-foreground-primary-on-dark hover:underline" href="https://suno.com/about">About</a></div><div><a class="text-[0.75rem] leading-[155%] font-medium text-foreground-primary-on-dark transition-colors hover:text-foreground-primary-on-dark hover:underline" href="https://suno.com/careers">Work at Suno</a></div><div><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[0.75rem] leading-[155%] font-medium text-foreground-primary-on-dark transition-colors hover:text-foreground-primary-on-dark hover:underline" href="https://suno.com/blog?tag=all">Blog</a></div><div><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[